    "title": "Springfield's government complex is nearly complete - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dekevion Gause ,\n46 minutes ago SPRINGFIELD, Fla. (WJHG/WECP) - Hurricane Michael left lasting damage across our area, and for Springfield, that’s meant six years of running city government out of temporary buildings and even an old library. But now, that’s about to change. Reliant South has made tremendous progress on Springfield’s brand-new government complex. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
